WEBVTT

01:05:29.579 --> 01:05:35.413
I know this is I agree that this is
really what has driven the future.

01:05:35.413 --> 01:05:39.079
Do you see some people get really now they
look at Silicon Valley and they look

01:05:39.079 --> 01:05:41.288
at this story and they worry
about the culture. Right.

01:05:41.329 --> 01:05:43.704
That it's this is a bro culture.

01:05:44.079 --> 01:05:48.663
Do you see prospects of that changing
anytime soon? And would you welcome it?

01:05:48.663 --> 01:05:52.663
Can we get better companies by
really working to expand

01:05:52.663 --> 01:05:55.288
a group of people who
can be entrepreneurs

01:05:55.288 --> 01:05:57.454
and who can contribute
to aid, for example?

01:05:57.496 --> 01:06:00.413
For sure. And in fact,
I think I'm hopeful,